  "intent_understood_as": "balanced_operation",
  "reason": "Intent mandates ae model and balanced_operation (<=5.0 false alarms/hour). ae at default threshold w3 p1 yields 24.34/h, exceeding the budget. Raising persistence to 3 cuts ae false alarms to ~7.7/h (per capability card), still above 5.0. No ae configuration meets the 5.0/h hard constraint; this policy is the closest achievable while respecting the model choice, minimizing false alarms as much as possible."
